jIyNTViODg2NWQ2IiwidCI6ImRmODY3OWNkLWE4MGUtNDVkOC05OWFjLWM4M2VkN2ZmOTVhMCJ9&source=post_page-----fbb68f3dade6---------------------------------------)#Report powered by Power BI#{1}":[20,23],"##Contents":[24,38],"##Contents#{1}":[26,38],"##What you’re building":[39,54],"##What you’re building#{1}":[41,54],"##Naming used in this guide":[55,65],"##Naming used in this guide#{1}":[57,65],"##The building blocks":[66,73],"##The building blocks#{1}":[68,73],"##Block 1 — Selector (the slicer’s choices)":[74,97],"##Block 1 — Selector (the slicer’s choices)#{1}":[76,97],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector":[98,120],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#{1}":[100,114],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#Steps:":[115,120],"##Optional — sorting your real category column, not just the Selector#Steps:#{1}":[117,120],"##Block 2 — Position measures":[121,156],"##Block 2 — Position measures#{1}":[123,156],"##Block 3 — Color by position":[157,171],"##Block 3 — Color by position#{1}":[159,160],"##Block 3 — Color by position#1\\. Select the chart → Format visual → Data colors.":[161,162],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:":[163,167],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{1}":[165,167],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).":[168,171],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).#{1}":[170,171],"##Wiring it up in the report":[172,191],"##Wiring it up in the report#{1}":[175,176],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:":[177,182],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{1}":[179,182],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:":[183,187],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{1}":[185,187],"##Wiring it up in the r